# app/google-services.json is intentionally COMMITTED, not ignored.
# The Android API key inside it is not a secret — it ships inside every APK and
# can be extracted by decompiling. Firestore security rules (see firestore.rules)
# are what actually protect the data. Committing it lets CI build a
# Firebase-enabled APK.
